OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 14 Nov to Mon 23 Nov
OL,6,FHigh pressure will initially dominate,
OL,7,Fwith widely settled conditions and
OL,8,Fovernight frost. Some showers are
OL,9,Flikely in northern and western
OL,10,FScotland though, and perhaps along
OL,11,Fsome other western coasts for a time.
OL,12,FLater in the weekend, a transition to
OL,13,Fmore unsettled conditions is expected
OL,14,Fas bands of rain, and associated areas
OL,15,Fof low pressure, arrive from the North
OL,16,FAtlantic, bringing more widespread wet
OL,17,Fand windy weather. It is likely to
OL,18,Fremain fairly changeable through the
OL,19,Fremainder of the period, with
OL,20,Foccasional rain interspersed with
OL,21,Fbrighter, showery spells. Whilst
OL,22,Fcolder conditions will be possible at
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ftimes, especially at first, it will
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Foften be mild, with temperatures near
OL,25,For a little above average for the time
OL,26,Fof year.
